          <option value="9" selected>9 ft (Modern 9-ft Ceilings)</option>
          <option value="10">10 ft (Tall 1-Story / High Ceiling)</option>
          <option value="18">18 ft (Standard 2-Story)</option>
          <option value="20">20 ft (Tall 2-Story)</option>
