        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-gray-500">Opening Deductions:</span>
          <strong id="r_deductions" class="text-gray-800 ml-1">243 sq ft (15 openings)</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="text-gray-500">Net Wall Area:</span>
